anagement Service Portal widgets to quickly access knowledge articles from the Service Portal homepage","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/knowledge-management/conf-service-portal-know-management.md","line":41},{"title":"Configure the Knowledge Management Service Portal","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/knowledge-management/knowledge-management-service-portal.md","line":45},{"title":"Service Portal pages","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-user-interface/c_Pages.md","line":50},{"title":"Knowledge Management Service Portal homepage features","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/knowledge-management/knowledge-service-portal-pages.md","line":52},{"title":"Using search in Knowledge Management Service Portal","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/knowledge-management/knowledge-service-portal-search.md","line":54},{"title":"Knowledge Management Service Portal article view page features","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/knowledge-management/knowledge-service-portal-view.md","line":56},{"title":"Activate the Knowledge Management Service Portal plugin","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/knowledge-management/activate-km-service-portal-plugin.md","line":66},{"title":"HTML","target":"html","line":126},{"title":"Widget developer guide","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-user-interface/widget-dev-guide.md","line":153},{"title":"Knowledge Management Service Portal widgets","target":"km-service-portal-widget-instances","line":174},{"title":"Knowledge Management Service Portal widgets","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/knowledge-management/km-service-portal-widget-instances.md","line":182},{"title":"Knowledge Management","target":"knowledge-management","line":211},{"title":"HTML","target":"html","line":212},{"title":"Knowledge Management Service Portal widgets","target":"km-service-portal-widget-instances","line":213}],"metadata":{"title":"Integrating Knowledge Management features with the Service Portal","description":"To create a consistent user experience for Knowledge Management, integrate Knowledge Management Service Portal in your end-user facing Service Portal.Use a page route map to access the enhanced Knowledge Management homepage from the Service Portal homepage.Use a custom knowledge search widget to access the enhanced Knowledge Management search results page from the Service Portal search results page.Add the Knowledge Management Service Portal widgets Featured Articles, Most Useful Articles, and Most Rated Articles to the Service Portal homepage to quickly access knowledge articles.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/servicenow-platform/knowledge-management/conf-service-portal-know-management.html","release":"australia","product":"Knowledge Management","classification":"knowledge-management","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":6,"breadcrumb":["Configure the Knowledge Management Service Portal","Configuring Knowledge Management","Knowledge Management","Manage content capabilities","Extend ServiceNow AI Platform capabilities"],"tags":["#servicenow-platform","#knowledge-management","#kb","#articles","#search","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[132,137],[141,151]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/servicenow-platform/knowledge-management/conf-service-portal-know-management.md"},
